# Project core

- Monorepo: `backend-core` (.NET 9 API), `velora-frontend` (React/Vite), `admin-panel` (Next.js), `chat-ai-module` (FastAPI).
- Read `AGENTS.md` and nearby code before changing architecture.
- Prefer small, verifiable diffs. Do not touch unrelated apps or `publish/` / `publish-chat/`.
- Do not invent scripts; use commands documented in `AGENTS.md` / package files.
- Never commit secrets or paste real connection strings/tokens into docs.
- Do not commit unless the user explicitly asks.
- Preserve dirty user changes; avoid drive-by refactors.
- Backend is net9.0 + PostgreSQL (Npgsql), not the outdated README claim of .NET 8 / SQL Server.
- Platform admin lives in `velora-frontend` (`/admin`). Company widget admin is `admin-panel`. Do not mix them.
